    deliverables: Full-study NT
    gate-shape: Ramified OS
    model: Sonnet 5 tier
round-2:
    nt-layout: Folder+file (per-folder dtd + per-file args)
    os-seals: Extended-OS + Heavy-seals
    timeouts: Per-job-ceiling
    schematic: Depth+Type + Cube-preview + Polyglot + Skills-redo (all marked yes)
round-3:
    deep: Both hadal and hadopelagia
    ask-forms: Bracket + Angle-mark + Caret-matrix + Empty-chain, hadopelagia UNCAPPED (Other-answer, binding)
    sigil: Full-simplify + DTD-variants
