    release: audit-sh + CI + bypass + reverse-gulp + README (all four)
    preview: audit-all with cube
    depth-impl: schematic + brackets + NT38-map + YAML-mix (all four)
resume-run:
    mode: Resume-cache, Comprehensive, prior-answers-stand
    correction: cache answers are known slots — no re-ask (binding on all future runs)

fixed-decisions:
    priority: full-study-nt-first
    gate: ramified gate-1-linux gate-2-windows gate-3-macos, ordered/manual options
    thinking-table: SUPERSEDED by LZ-BINARY §14 correction (rev 14) — MAX_THINKING_TOKENS stale on 5-series; live dial is effort, hard zero is thinking-disabled (opus-5), budget UNSET
    cache-timer: 60m with retrigger count; .nt polyarm + .md >>> nesting

session-2-many-run:
