    next-workstream: Skill-suite selected, then REDIRECTED by gate to overhaul order (dtd done, Commands, Skills, Agents)
    commits: per-workstream (new policy; nothing committed yet)
    sweep: src/commands staleness grep — zero hits (no stale numbers, no stale family lists)
